 # AMDGPU\_TOP
 `amdgpu_top` is tool that display AMD GPU utilization, like
 [umr](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/tomstdenis/umr/) or
 [clbr/radeontop](https://github.com/clbr/radeontop) or
 [intel_gpu_top](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/drm/igt-gpu-tools/-/blob/master/man/intel_gpu_top.rst).
 .
 The tool displays information gathered from performance counters (GRBM, GRBM2),
 sensors, fdinfo, and AMDGPU driver.
